{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is found, approach and take it, check properties, move and do a specific task. Else, scan the area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = FindObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = ScanForObject    />",
